WEBVTT

00:01:56.810 --> 00:02:01.677
And I am also proud of being part
of the Costa Rica delegation to COP25

00:02:01.701 --> 00:02:03.893
in Spain last December.

00:02:06.060 --> 00:02:09.176
AG: Nana Firman, born in Indonesia,

00:02:09.200 --> 00:02:12.166
is a climate advocate extraordinaire

00:02:12.190 --> 00:02:15.256
and calls herself
a daughter of the rain forest.

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:18.126
Nana is the Muslim Coordinator
for GreenFaith

00:02:18.150 --> 00:02:22.206
and cofounder of the Global
Muslim Climate Network.

00:02:22.230 --> 00:02:26.636
Nana Firman: My name is Nana Firman,
and I am a Climate Reality Leader.

00:02:26.660 --> 00:02:27.816
In my life journey,

00:02:27.840 --> 00:02:31.266
I realized that our behavior
and consumption habits